{"resource":{"id":"rust-learning-roadmap","title":"Rust \u2014 Learning Roadmap","category":"Programming","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"9 min","pages":12,"lastUpdated":"September 2026","tags":["Programming","Rust","Systems"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1454165804606-c3d57bc86b40?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"A structured 8-week path from Rust newcomer to production-ready engineer \u2014 with milestones, projects, books, and interview prep."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"w1","label":"Week 1 \u2014 Basics"},{"id":"w2","label":"Week 2 \u2014 Ownership"},{"id":"w3","label":"Week 3 \u2014 Structs, Enums, Traits"},{"id":"w4","label":"Week 4 \u2014 Collections & Errors"},{"id":"w5","label":"Week 5 \u2014 Concurrency"},{"id":"w6","label":"Week 6 \u2014 Async + Networking"},{"id":"w7","label":"Week 7 \u2014 Real Project"},{"id":"w8","label":"Week 8 \u2014 Ship & Interview"},{"id":"books","label":"Books & Courses"},{"id":"portfolio","label":"Portfolio Projects"},{"id":"best","label":"Best Practices"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary & Key Takeaways"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"Rust \u2014 Tips & Tricks","tag":"Programming","time":"8 min"},{"title":"Rust \u2014 FAQ","tag":"Programming","time":"10 min"},{"title":"Rust \u2014 Beginner Guide","tag":"Programming","time":"24 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Move from install to production Rust in 8 focused weeks.</li>\n          <li>Build a portfolio + interview-ready resume.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1520607162513-77705c0f0d4a?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 \u2014 Small daily wins compound into fluency.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"w1\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Week 1 \u2014 Basics</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <Week n={1} title=\"Setup + Hello Rust\" items={[\"Install rustup + rust-analyzer\", \"Run cargo new / build / test\", \"Variables, functions, control flow\"]} />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"w2\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Week 2 \u2014 Ownership</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <Week n={2} title=\"Ownership & Borrowing\" items={[\"Move vs copy semantics\", \"&T, &mut T rules\", \"Slices and strings\"]} />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"w3\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Week 3 \u2014 Structs, Enums, Traits</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <Week n={3} title=\"Type system\" items={[\"Enums + pattern matching\", \"Traits + impl blocks\", \"Generics basics\"]} />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"w4\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Week 4 \u2014 Collections &amp; Errors</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <Week n={4} title=\"Std library workhorses\" items={[\"Vec, HashMap, iterators\", \"Result / Option / ?\", \"anyhow + thiserror\"]} />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"w5\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Week 5 \u2014 Concurrency</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <Week n={5} title=\"Threads & sync\" items={[\"Arc, Mutex, channels\", \"rayon parallel iterators\", \"Data-race-free design\"]} />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"w6\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Week 6 \u2014 Async + Networking</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <Week n={6} title=\"Tokio + reqwest + axum\" items={[\"async/await mental model\", \"HTTP client + server\", \"Serde JSON\"]} />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"w7\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Week 7 \u2014 Real Project</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Ship a small CLI, HTTP service, or WASM module. Add tests, docs, and a README.</p>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>Suggestions:\n- URL-shortener (axum + sqlite)\n- Markdown-to-HTML CLI\n- Live metrics scraper</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"w8\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Week 8 \u2014 Ship &amp; Interview</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Publish crate on crates.io.</li>\n          <li>Write a blog post about lessons learned.</li>\n          <li>Practice 20 interview questions.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517694712202-14dd9538aa97?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 \u2014 Ship publicly \u2014 the deadline sharpens focus.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"books\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Books &amp; Courses</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><em>The Rust Programming Language</em> (Klabnik & Nichols).</li>\n          <li><em>Rust for Rustaceans</em> (Gjengset).</li>\n          <li><em>Zero to Production in Rust</em> (Pascutto).</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"portfolio\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Portfolio Projects</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>URL shortener (backend + tests + CI).</li>\n          <li>gRPC microservice with observability.</li>\n          <li>WebAssembly demo (Rust \u2192 WASM).</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"best\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Best Practices</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Ship weekly, however small.</li>\n          <li>Write publicly \u2014 teaching cements learning.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"/><path d=\"M9 18h6\"/><path d=\"M10 22h4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Tip</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">Skip tutorials after Week 3 \u2014 build instead.</div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Two months of deliberate practice moves most engineers from \"curious\" to \"hire-ready.\"</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Full-time?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">1 hour/day is enough \u2014 consistency beats binges.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Adjust pacing to your background; this is a template not a mandate.</p>\n      </div></section>"}